  "launches": [
    {
      "id": 83220,
      "title": "Conversational Replicas by Tavus",
      "tagline": "Build with real-time digital twins that speak, see, and hear",
      "body": "Hey everyone!\\\n\\\nWe're Quinn and Hassaan, co-founders of Tavus. At Tavus, we build AI models and APIs to empower development teams to build digital twin experiences with video generation and, now, real-time conversational video.\n\nWith the _Conversational Video Interface_, developers can build live video conversations with digital twins that speak, see, and hear. It's the world's only end-to-end conversational pipeline with less than a second of latency.\\\n\\\n**Live Demo**\n\n» Try talk to Carter, our demo Digital Twin, today at [www.tavus.io](http://www.tavus.io)\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=83220&key=user_uploads/731467/1e35574a-dbe4-425d-b9f3-f83d2d0e2752)\n\n**Challenge?** Consumers are feeling more isolated and detached than ever with the saturation of digital products and services, and they seek connectedness.\\\n\\\n**What are we launching?** Tavus is launching the Conversational Video Interface. It provides developers with all the tools they need to easily build innovative, immersive, and highly engaging conversational video experiences with digital twins that mimic real-life interactions.\n\nThis brings a human face, voice, emotion, and intelligence to daily digital interactions via life-like digital twins.\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=83220&key=user_uploads/731467/d6a855ad-878d-48c2-a98b-75e758c9fd38)\n\n**Use Cases**\n\nImagine getting live help from a human-like digital twin when buying something online, dealing with the DMV website, making a doctor's appointment, or booking travel.\n\nOr imagine speaking to an expert's digital twin, someone you otherwise couldn’t access.\n\nThese are the types of conversational video experiences you can build with the power of real-time digital twins and AI agents.\n\n**Try the LIVE DEMO!**\n\nSee the magic for yourself…\n\nChat with our demo digital twin, Carter. You can find him at [www.tavus.io.](http://www.tavus.io/)\n\n**Feedback welcome**\n\nWe’re excited to see what you build, and hear what you think!\n\n**Message us with feedback**\n\nDM on X:\\\n<https://x.com/hassaanraza97> \\\n<https://x.com/qfav95>\\\n<https://x.com/heytavus>\\\nDiscord Community:\\\n<https://discord.gg/mFHMcFKn>\n\nAppreciate your support!\\\nQuinn & Hassaan",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/LeG-conversational-replicas-by-tavus",
      "votes": 29,
